{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_05",
  "title": "貨與人",
  "storyCode": "IW-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9924cbcecf364dad1ae1ebebed41ab40db37777218fd023752b0619fd1bdfb56",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "5下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g09_teahouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一杯晌午茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，尚師傅慢坐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天怎麼上工這麼遲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一早遇見了個老熟人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼熟人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，實在沒想到今天又能見到師傅您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼，還在找那什麼涼亭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有師傅替我劃出範圍，輕鬆不少，但我要找的，畢竟是人不是亭，還是有點難的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那邊坐著的，是你情人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，我還沒那膽子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，難不成是你女兒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我哪像是為人父的樣子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你剛剛說什麼！我和這個龍門騙子是什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一對男女，在早春的這個時間登山，多半是閒得沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尚師傅，晌午茶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晌午茶？這還沒到晌午吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凡是在尚蜀山上行走的挑夫，都可以在山腰山腳的茶館白喝兩頓茶水。上午一頓晌午茶，下午一頓日落茶，各送些小菜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白喝的茶水，滋味總是不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "茶水罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可畢竟是在山上，山上的茶水，總是貴一些的。那既然是不要錢的，還是賺到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你倒是會算帳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可店家真的這麼好心？都是做慈善來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然是官府掏錢補貼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你懂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "家裡也是做餐飲生意的，當然懂得多點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尚蜀官府如此貼心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁大人上任之後一直如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前幾任尚蜀官員，興建土木，開發山林，不僅讓城市從百廢待興中恢復過來，而且變得更加生機勃勃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到了梁洵梁大人這兒，興許是認為尚蜀已經修葺一新，便把重心轉移到安民厚民之上......這些事，無非是其中最細末的瑣事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......年紀輕輕，懂得不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "家父從商，耳濡目染罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有個好父親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "茶喝完了，我也該走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後會有期，尚師傅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_302_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後會有期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——喂！姓鯉的，酒盞怎麼會在他身上！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不清楚。但他根本沒有藏的意思，那麼坦蕩蕩掛在腰上，就像是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "故意讓人來找他似的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......罷了，我們也喝壺茶，靜觀其變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小二！上兩壺茶，兩碗爛肉麵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我吃兩碗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "客官，這是兩壺茶水，只是麵要等等，今天人多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多謝......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼還跟到這裡來了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......嗷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，姓鯉的，問你個事，你別笑話我啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那茶壺，是不是自己在動......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爛肉麵來啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好險，差點摔一跤！客官留點神，我這還端著麵呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗷嗚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這是個啥？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——喂，你沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些鍋碗瓢盆，布幌字畫......都從房子裡......跑出來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被嚇到的客人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_304_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呀——！這是什麼！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火！火，這個怪物著了火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......它們是衝著我們來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，姓鯉的！這到底是怎麼回事？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來關於那隻酒盞的傳聞竟然是真的......這裡人多，先走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g01_yanstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼聯繫鯉小子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......鯉先生在信裡留言，讓我們會合之後，就去取江峰的山頂找他。如果他沒到，就等他到日落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。我們抓緊吧，可不能讓酒盞落入別人手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人，之前那些與墨魎相似的幻靈，如何是好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多半和那隻酒盞有關......先去找鯉先生會合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗷嗚——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人，它們，是不是，變多了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......？這是什麼品種的野獸？這兩天怎麼總能見到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被包圍了呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，好凶好凶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——沒法子了！恩人，你和慎師傅先走，我來應付這些玩意！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你沒問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和墨魎大抵差不多的路數，還算應付得來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慎師傅！這邊走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g11_yanroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了，一副心神不寧的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你擔心人的時候，總是皺著眉頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有的，誰這麼值得梁大人上心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我在擔心我那位朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他入了一個局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你讓他入的局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你現在愧疚了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我還是相信這是最好的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是我不確定......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_298_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很聰明，梁大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算不得聰明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_295_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是選了個笨法子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g06_mountainroad_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......大炎的野獸，都是長這樣的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯？阿燈？啊，不要緊張啦......嗯，有你們陪著我就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鑽頭！就這樣抓住它！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "speakerId": "avg_476_blkngt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從沒見過的炎國野獸啊......也許會成為出其不意的陷阱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g01_yanstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉！怎麼回事，我最近是命裡犯鬼怪了嗎，怎麼成天要和這些稀奇古怪的生物作對的！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——唔哦！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚嗷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......定睛細看，這些東西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（糟糕——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生沒受傷吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是，那天的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勿問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太合叔，不必這麼生分......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你們知道這些東西的來歷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那隻酒盞所過之處，器倀四起，反而證明了司歲台的猜測。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是不是說明......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "公子慎言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......太合叔教訓得是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚嗷——嗚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這些幻靈，呃，器倀......是在害怕這兩個人？不，是在害怕這個少年......？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看這些器倀，這樣的事情發生過幾次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十年前一次，二十五年前一次，再前一甲子，仍有數次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖說偶有善使源石技藝的惡人鬧事，情況也不比這好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可歲終究是歲，獸終究是獸，你們若是有心為害天下，天知道會有多大的災難？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器倀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗷——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "司歲台不想看到這樣的事情發生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我們要把這筆千年來的糊塗帳算乾淨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器倀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_306_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不過是些殘渣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些東西......變回普通器具了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏有先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麻煩轉告克洛絲姐姐，還請她再考慮考慮我所說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "買賣不成仁義在，哪怕最後克洛絲姐姐有自己的考量，那我這裡，也有一個不論身份也想委託羅德島的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒問題是沒問題，可那時你為什麼不自己對恩人說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哈哈，那個時候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有點緊張，話沒說全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_299_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "公子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼......我們似乎也耽擱不起了，烏有先生，就此告辭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......緊張？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帶著一個副監察御史到處亂跑的公子哥，也會緊張的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
